        "id": 228208,
        "name": "Under3",
        "username": "Under3",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/under3/{size}/1872_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-07-30T09:39:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, that exactly. I'd recommend reading over a couple of comics and seeing what plot contrivances you could see as twists happening for the characters - there's often quite a lot of them. It could help with ideas for new twists in your own adventures.</p>\n<p>I'm reading the classic Excalibur comics at the moment as I think that feel is right for what I want to do, almost every other panel something happens which could be a twist!</p>",
